SRR11870470	PRJNA603106	SRP265179	SAMN13919429	SRX8420177	Homo sapiens	P2_normal_WES	P2_normal_WES	BGISEQ-500 sequencing: GSM4284251: P2_normal_WES Homo sapiens OTHER	OTHER	GENOMIC	other	PAIRED	BGISEQ	BGISEQ-500	Approximately 10-12 8mm sections of fresh-frozen tissue in OCT were dissolved in PBS to remove OCT. The tissue was pelleted and used as input for the DNeasy Blood and Tissue Kit (Qiagen) to extract genomic DNA. The Agilent V6 whole exome capture kit (60 Mbp) was used and the resulting libraries were sequenced on the BGISEQ-500 instrument using paired-end 100bp reads to achieve approximately 100x coverage for each tumor sample and 50x coverage for each normal skin sample.	92586388	9256638205	ftp.sra.ebi.ac.uk/vol1/fastq/SRR118/070/SRR11870470/SRR11870470_1.fastq.gz;ftp.sra.ebi.ac.uk/vol1/fastq/SRR118/070/SRR11870470/SRR11870470_2.fastq.gz	f07b7c06a465c30c4692a025e3c59843;072221733a15941d9c72747981a9ce23	3211221983;3358257772
